    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100700502/1007005020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005020140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ぽっと出の素人がやっていけると思う？\r\n飛び抜けて魅力があるとか、天才だとかじゃないのに",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700502/1007005020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005020150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "（……や、やっていけると思えたから\r\nあのお兄さん、声かけてくれたんじゃないのー……？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700502/1007005020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005020160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あの人をそこまで信用できる根拠とは",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700502/1007005020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005020170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "自分に都合のいいこと言ってくれる人だから、って\r\n信じようとしてない？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_jito",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700502/1007005020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005020180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "（い、否めなーい……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
