  {
    "id": 1007005020190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あと、大学",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700502/1007005020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005020200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "勉強して仕事して……って二重生活になるけど、\r\n具体的に考えてる？　バイトとはわけが違うんだよ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700502/1007005020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005020210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "まさか、アイドルになったから辞める──とか\r\n無責任なこと言わないよね？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700502/1007005020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007005020220,
